### Names

- Match the project's naming for classes and files, with or without type suffixes (`Orders` in `orders.ts`, or `OrdersService` in `orders.service.ts`), as its `angular.json` generator settings request; never mix the two styles.
<!-- Project-specific / Angular-Names -->

